<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait names new health minister.</title>
<headline>Kuwait names new health minister.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Emir Sheikh Jaber al-Ahmad al-Sabah on Wednesday appointed Anwar al-Nouri Health Minister, an emiri decree said.</p>
<p>Nouri takes over from Sheikh Saud Nasser al-Sabah, Kuwait's information minister who was made acting health minister when the new 14-man cabinet was formed on October 15.</p>
</text>
